IW4L (modified)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MW2 runtime (iw4l-re4.exe) is built from a modified copy of IW4L.

  IW4L - Copyright 2026 vladtrc
  https://github.com/vladtrc/iw4L
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Base revision: 4d65a39376e14390abe21bd9ad24a28c2687e90f

Ermes_x86 (Payne) modified IW4L to run as a gameplay runtime for the
MW2-GTA bridge, and further for this RE4 plugin. The changes are active only
when the IW4L_GTA_BRIDGE environment variable is set (the RE4 changes only
when IW4L_RE4_BRIDGE is also set); standalone IW4L behaviour is preserved.
The RE4 changes (runtime-patches/re4-bridge.patch) cover: the MW2 player
never dying, guns and ammo set from the host's inventory, the host's clip
sizes, grenades from the host only, and a slimmer player against host
walls.

IW4L's own NOTICE, LICENSE and THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt are included in
the release under licenses\ and apply to the runtime built from it.

